id: precognition
name: Precognition
uaType: magical
prerequisite: Insight Score of 7+, 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
tpCost: 30
type: instant
actionCost: 0
# The Effect: an Opponent yet to act this Combat Round moved to the turn after the current one - picked when it
# is used (use-maneuver.mjs askPrecognition) - and, for that turn, a Counter Action and 1(T) on Strike and Dodge
# Rolls against them (system.foresight).
foresees: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Instant: an Opponent yet to act goes next; during their turn, a Counter Action and 1(T) on Strike and Dodge
  Rolls against them. Passive: Initiative 1(T) higher, and the Foresight Adventuring Maneuver.
text: >
  Precognition: You can witness the future, allowing you to respond accordingly.
  –Ability Type: Magical
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 7+, 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
  –TP Cost: 30
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Maneuver Type: Instant
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: Increase your Initiative by 1(T) and gain access to the Foresight Adventuring Maneuver.
  –Effect: Target an Opponent who hasn’t done their turn yet. For this Combat Round, move their place in the
  Initiative Order to the next turn after the current one. If you do, you gain 1 Counter Action to use during
  their turn and increase your Strike and Dodge Rolls against that Opponent by 1(T) for the duration of that
  turn.

---

# The Foresight Adventuring Maneuver waits on its text (the user's ruling: left pending).

# "Increase your Initiative by 1(T)."
[passive]
initiative += 1(T);
